===== Task 6: Count smart phones with 6-inch screen =====\
\
COMMAND:\
db.electronics.countDocuments(\{\
    type: "smart phone",\
    "screen size": 6\
\})\
\
OUTPUT:\
catalog> db.electronics.countDocuments(\{\
|     type: "smart phone",\
|     "screen size": 6\
| \})\
8\
catalog> \
\
\
===== Task 7: Average screen size =====\
\
COMMAND:\
db.electronics.aggregate([\
    \{\
        $match: \{ type: "smart phone" \}\
    \},\
    \{\
        $group: \{\
            _id: null,\
            average_screen_size: \{\
                $avg: "$screen size"\
            \}\
        \}\
    \}\
])\
\
OUTPUT:\
